<h1>Affiliate Rolodex — Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="muted">Last updated: October 26, 2026</p>

<h2>Who we are</h2>
<p>Affiliate Rolodex (Android app <code>com.usefulappz.rolodex</code>) is developed by Usefulappz™ (Mike Kelley). Contact: <a href="mailto:mikekelleyii.mk2@gmail.com">mikekelleyii.mk2@gmail.com</a></p>

<h2>The short version</h2>
<p>Affiliate Rolodex stores affiliate programs — the program name, its link, any discount code, and its disclosure line — in one place, so the links stay current everywhere they are used. It collects <strong>no personal data</strong>: no accounts, no analytics, no ads SDK, no tracking, and nothing is sold.</p>

<h2>How the app works</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The app reads the rolodex entries from <strong>our server</strong> and displays them: program name, link, code, and disclosure, always together — an entry never renders without its disclosure.</li>
  <li>Tapping a link opens it in your <strong>system browser</strong>, outside this app. The destination site's own privacy policy applies there; any affiliate cookie is set by that destination site, not by this app.</li>
</ul>

<h2>What the app stores</h2>
<p>The rolodex entries live on our server (they are the developer's own affiliate program records — names, links, and codes, not information about you). The app stores nothing about you on your device beyond its own display state, and it sends us nothing about you.</p>

<h2>Permissions, and why</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Internet</strong> — used only to read the current rolodex entries from our server, as described above.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Ads</h2>
<p>Affiliate Rolodex contains <strong>no ads and no advertising SDK</strong>. The affiliate links it stores are labeled with their disclosure wherever they appear.</p>

<h2>Children</h2>
<p>Affiliate Rolodex is a business tool. It is not directed at children under 13, and it collects no data from anyone.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>If this policy changes, the new version will be posted at this URL with a new "last updated" date.</p>

